                                "example_id": "b8e928cc-19a2-4901-ada5-07cfd044afdd",
                                "sense_id": "b5538a08-45fd-39ae-8ff0-8de490f18ca4",
                                "text": "He had discerned that I was with child. He was a physician first. When he came around offering to see me through my baby's nascence, Mother so thoroughly scolded him for his audacity that he was again left speechless. \"I will see to the birth ...\""
                            }
